          "cookies": [],
          "content": {
            "size": 2573,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\n    <title>BrowserBench.org &mdash; Browser Benchmarks</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"resources/main.css\">\n    <script>\n    function chooseAsset(img) {\n        var ratio = window.devicePixelRatio;\n        var srcset = img.getAttribute('srcset');\n        if (!srcset)\n            return null;\n        var tokens = srcset.split(/\\s*,\\s*/);\n        for (var i = 0; i < tokens.length; i++) {\n            var parsedToken = tokens[i].match(/(.+)\\s+(\\d)x/);\n            if (parsedToken && parseInt(parsedToken[2]) == ratio)\n                return parsedToken[1];\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    if (!HTMLImageElement.prototype.hasOwnProperty(\"srcset\")) {\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n            var images = document.querySelectorAll('img');\n            for (var i = 0; i < images.length; i++) {\n                if (!images[i].srcset)\n                    images[i].src = chooseAsset(images[i]);\n            }\n        });\n    }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"benchmark-index\">\n<main>\n\n<div id=\"logo\">\n<a href=\"/\"><span class=\"light\">browser</span><span class=\"normal\">bench</span><span class=\"highlight\">.</span><span class=\"light\">org</span></a>\n</div>\n\n<hr>\n\n<a class=\"benchmark\" href=\"Speedometer3.1\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<img id=\"speedometer-logo\"\n    srcset=\"resources/Speedometer-Logo.png 1x, resources/Speedometer-Logo@2x.png 2x\" alt=\"Speedometer\">\n<p>Speedometer is a browser benchmark that measures the responsiveness of web applications.<br>\nIt's maintained by major browser engine developers under an open governance model.</p>\n</a>\n\n<hr>\n\n<section class=\"benchmarks\">\n\n<a class=\"benchmark\" href=\"JetStream3.0\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<img id=\"jetstream-logo\"\n    srcset=\"resources/JetStream3-Logo.png 1x, resources/JetStream3-Logo@2x.png 2x\" alt=\"JetStream3\">\n<p>JetStream 3.0 is a JavaScript and WebAssembly benchmark suite focused on advanced web applications.</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"benchmark\" href=\"MotionMark1.3.2\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<img id=\"motionmark-logo\" srcset=\"resources/MotionMark-Logo.png 1x, resources/MotionMark-Logo@2x.png 2x\" alt=\"MotionMark\">\n<p>MotionMark is a benchmark designed to put browser graphics systems to the test.</p>\n</a>\n\n</section>\n\n<hr>\n\n<section class=\"announcements\">\n    <a href=\"announcements\"><span class=\"light\">browser</span><span class=\"normal\">bench</span><span class=\"highlight\">.</span><span class=\"light\">org</span> <span>announcements</span></a>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
          },
